        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "37337e73-c8e6-5aa5-b86d-70ee07400100",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: 101 Dalmatians (1996 film), G-Force\n- People: Cruella de Vil, Dodie Smith, Florentine Houdinière\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures, Jerry Bruckheimer Films, Disney\n- Topics: The Hundred and One Dalmatians, Disney on Ice\n\nFacts:\n- Dodie Smith published the novel The Hundred and One Dalmatians in 1956.\n- Cruella de Vil appeared in Dodie Smith's 1956 novel The Hundred and One Dalmatians.\n- Disney released an animated film adaptation of The Hundred and One Dalmatians in 1961.\n- The 1996 American live-action comedy adventure film 101 Dalmatians is based on Disney's 1961 animated adaptation of Dodie Smith's 1956 novel The Hundred and One Dalmatians.\n- From 1996 to 1998, Florentine Houdinière skated as Belle in the Disney on Ice show Beauty and the Beast.\n- In 1998, Florentine Houdinière skated as Cruella de Vil in the Disney on Ice show Magical Fantasy.\n- Cruella de Vil is the main antagonist in Disney's animated film adaptations 101 Dalmatians and Disney's live-action film adaptations 101 Dalmatians and 102 Dalmatians.\n- G-Force is a 2009 American family comedy adventure film produced by Walt Disney Pictures and Jerry Bruckheimer Films.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "70197f61-6abc-5b4f-ba46-3527c078ae65",
        "text": "Page: 101 Dalmatians (1996 film). Sentence: 101 Dalmatians is a 1996 American live-action comedy adventure film based on Walt Disney's animated 1961 movie adaptation of Dodie Smith's 1956 novel \"The Hundred and One Dalmatians.\"\nPage: G-Force (film). Sentence: G-Force is a 2009 American family comedy adventure film produced by Walt Disney Pictures and Jerry Bruckheimer Films.\nPage: Cruella de Vil. Sentence: Cruella de Vil (spelled de Vil in the novel, spelled De Vil by Disney) is a character who appeared in Dodie Smith's 1956 novel \"The Hundred and One Dalmatians\", Disney's animated film adaptations \"101 Dalmatians\" and \"\", and Disney's live-action film adaptations \"101 Dalmatians\" and \"102 Dalmatians\" as the main antagonist.\nPage: Florentine Houdinière. Sentence: She has also skated in two shows for Disney on Ice, in \"Beauty and the Beast\" from 1996 to 1998 as Belle and in \"Magical Fantasy\" in 1998 as Cruella de Vil.",
